      "description": "Display your personalized text directly on your Home Screen, Lock Screen, and StandBy mode with MyText Widget. Perfect for reminders, affirmations, quotes, or any text you want to see at a glance. Keep important information visible without unlocking your device. Whether it's a daily motivational quote, a reminder of your priorities, or a note to yourself, MyText Widget makes your text accessible with just a glance.\n\nPersonalize your widget with a variety of options:\n• Choose from 5 elegant font styles: Serif, Rounded, Monospaced, Bold Italic, and Script\n• Select vibrant colors including Auto (adapts to light/dark mode), Yellow, Cyan, Pink, Blue, Lime, and Orange\n• Align text to left, center, or right\n• Automatic font size adjustment based on text length for optimal readability\n\nMultiple Widget Sizes\n• Small widget for short phrases\n• Medium widget for longer messages\n• Large widget for extended quotes or notes\n• Extra large widget for iPad users\n• Lock Screen widgets for quick viewing\n\nEasy to Use\n• Simple, clean interface with widget preview\n• One-tap clipboard paste functionality\n• Update widgets instantly with keyboard toolbar button\n• Visual feedback confirms all changes",
